al).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Text-Based Dialogue System:</strong> Dynamic narratives delivered through engaging dialogues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Driving:</strong> Fully physics-based car driving system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person exploration experience where realism is key. Navigate mysterious locations, face your darkest fears, and uncover disturbing truths hidden in the shadows of real-life cases.</p>",
